SeedVR2 Gradio Workbench

This project includes a modified copy of inference_cli.py derived from:
  https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler

The upstream project is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The modified inference_cli.py in this project adds or changes, among other things:
  - progress callbacks for cooperative pause and immediate-stop handling;
  - a selectable VAE model argument;
  - stable DiT/VAE cache identifiers for the in-process runtime;
  - interfaces used by the Gradio Workbench's chunk checkpoint pipeline.

